art, so a long instrument survives its session and a silent one reads as broken, not alive. `#2180` fixed the train's own half; this is the wrapper half every other long seat run needs.\n- `tools/audit/seat/failure_logs.sh` — the PR -> latest failing check-runs -> details_url -> job log -> error lines reader. Newest-started_at-per-name grouping (red-then-green is not a failure), NO-JOB for non-Actions checks, NO-LOG counted and exit-1 rather than read as a status, quota-paced.\n\n## Figures\n\n- `python3 tools/audit/seat/daemonize.py --self-test` -> SELF-TEST PASS (5 checks)\n- `bash tools/audit/seat/failure_logs.sh --self-test` -> passed=7 failed=0\n- `python3 tests/structure.py` -> STRUCTURE RATCHET PASSED\n\n## Mutation proof\n\n- daemonize: restoring line-buffering off reddens the buffering arm; append-mode relaunch arm reddens when the log is truncated instead of extended.\n- failure_logs: a NO-LOG reading as a status reddens the NO-LOG arm; the tail: fallback arm reddens when a missing log reports a confident zero.\n\n## Red checks\n\nnone at this head; `fast (3.14)` greens were the two main-data defects fixed by `#2173`/`#2179`, predating this branch.\n\n## Null control\n\nn/a: these are new standalone instruments; each self-test's mutation arms are the control (a sabotaged buffering/tail/NO-LOG arm reddens its own check, reverted after).\n\n## Forward-carry\n\nnone.\n\n## Friction\n\nnone.\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T07:20:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T08:35:49Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T08:35:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T08:35:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"cd4c929158a2cfb15746bc0d20ce5103cb615ce7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls/2191/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls/2191/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls